                                "sense_id": "7fcb49a9-8991-3466-b49a-cf0def460b8a",
                                "text": "Doctors in Nigeria have criticized a mass national identification registration policy, involving tens of millions of citizens, as Covid-19 cases and deaths rise in the country."
